    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Community Engagement Meeting Please mark this important date on your calendar and spread the word! This is a general meeting of the FBCA members and everyone from the community and surrounding areas is welcome. It is a great opportunity to take out your FBCA 2026 membership and to have a voice at the table as [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
